{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52093","headline":"缺题赞 · 太宗皇帝李世民","name":"缺题赞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"功成积劫印纹端，不是南山得恐难。\n眼覩数重金色润，手擎一片玉光寒。\n炼时百火精神透，藏处千年莹彩完。\n定果薰修真秘密，信心莫作等闲看。\n（见《大正新修大藏经》第五十二册元释详迈撰《辨僞录》卷五，云出元如意长老《圣旨特建释迦舍利灵通感通之塔碑文》。\n《佛祖统纪》卷四五作宋太宗《佛牙赞》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝李世民","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52093.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52093","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}